      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Figure 1, \"NHWA version 2 includes 80% of information from NHWA version 1: Out of 78 indicators in NHWA V1, 62 were maintained, 16 were dropped and 2 new indicators were added\". On the left, column 1 lists the ten modules of NHWA version 1 with their indicator counts and how many were merged or dropped: Module 1 (9 indicators, 1 dropped), Module 2 (7 indicators, 2 dropped), Module 3 (9 indicators, 5 merged, 2 dropped), Module 4 (8 indicators, 1 merged, 4 dropped), Module 5 (7 indicators, 2 merged, 2 dropped), Module 6 (10 indicators, 6 merged, 2 dropped), Module 7 (7 indicators, 1 merged, 3 dropped), Module 8 (8 indicators, 4 merged, 1 dropped), Module 9 (5 indicators, 4 merged) and Module 10 (8 indicators, 7 merged). On the right, column 2 lists the four modules of NHWA version 2, connected from column 1 by flow lines carrying circled numbers that indicate how many indicators were moved or moved and merged: Module 1 (12 indicators, receiving 8 from V1 Module 1, 5 from Module 5 and 6 from Module 6), Module 2 (7 indicators including 7 sub-indicators plus new indicator 02-01 highlighted in green, receiving 5 from V1 Module 2 and 7 from Module 3), Module 3 (5 indicators, receiving 4 from V1 Module 4 and 3 from Module 7), and Module 4 (5 indicators including 26 sub-indicators plus new indicator 04-03 highlighted in green, receiving 1 from V1 Module 6, 8 from Module 8, 5 from Module 9 and 5 from Module 10).",
